#. 武道場のロッカーにあった…
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "The titanium arrow..."
msgstr ""

#. ジュラルミン製の矢…
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It was in the dojo locker, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 間違いない。
#. <CLT 9>あれが凶器<CLT>だ。
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I have no doubt,\n"
"<CLT 9>that was the murder weapon<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…そうなのかな…？
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Are you sure...?"
msgstr ""

#. 何を気にしてんだ…？
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"You don't sound convinced.\n"
"What's the problem?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、モノクマファイルには…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well, cuz in the Monokuma File..."
msgstr ""

#. 凶器は、鉄パイプ程度の太さの
#. 棒状の物ってあるよ？
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...it said the weapon must've been\n"
"about as thick as a metal pipe, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 矢だと<CLT 9>細過ぎる<CLT>と
#. 思うんだけど…
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It seems like an arrow would\n"
"just be <CLT 9>too thin<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様に口答えなんて…
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Talking back to Master..."
msgstr ""

#. １億年早いわよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You have no r-right!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ちょっと待ってよ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hold on a second...!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>白夜様が言うんだから…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Everyone l-listen to Master!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>うーむ…確かに…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Well, I mean...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>どうだっていいわよ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>It doesn't matter...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>まだ、分からんのか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>You still don't understand?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
